# VM Layout

For a POC, you can install Kafka on a separate VM or on the ZooKeeper VM.

Example:

| VM   | Service                      |
| ---- | ---------------------------- |
| VM-1 | Coordinator + Overlord       |
| VM-2 | Router + Broker              |
| VM-3 | Historical + MiddleManager   |
| VM-4 | ZooKeeper + Kafka (POC only) |

For production, Kafka and ZooKeeper are typically on separate clusters.

