# Step 8 - Submit the Supervisor (VM-1)

Submit to the Overlord:

```bash
curl -X POST \
http://<VM1-IP>:8090/druid/indexer/v1/supervisor \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d @kafka-supervisor.json
```

The Overlord creates the supervisor and assigns Kafka indexing tasks to the MiddleManager.

